# Default owners for everything. Replace `@your-org/...` with your real teams.
*                                  @your-org/agent-platform

# An agent's source-of-truth file gets a stricter review (platform + safety).
agents/**/agent.yaml               @your-org/agent-platform @your-org/safety
agents/**/system-prompt*           @your-org/agent-platform @your-org/safety
agents/**/evals/                   @your-org/agent-platform @your-org/safety

# CI / secret-provider wiring requires platform + security.
.github/workflows/                 @your-org/agent-platform @your-org/security
.github/actions/claude-managed-agents-pipeline/      @your-org/agent-platform @your-org/security
docs/credentials.md                @your-org/security
